],"effects":[{"id":1626138600,"name":"攻擊力增幅","nameEn":"攻擊力增幅","nameKey":"CombatPropertyCalculate.DisplayName.AttackPointMultiplier..","calculateType":"COMBATPROPERTYCALCULATETYPE_ATTACK_POINT_MULTIPLIER","unit":"percent","displayScale":100,"sourceDisplayType":"STATBOOSTDISPLAYTYPE_PERCENT","scope":{"characters":["CHARACTERTYPE_COOKIE"],"roles":[],"elements":[]},"order":34,"sortingOrder":1},{"id":2085906729,"name":"防禦力增幅","nameEn":"防禦力增幅","nameKey":"CombatPropertyCalculate.DisplayName.DefensePointMultiplier..","calculateType":"COMBATPROPERTYCALCULATETYPE_DEFENSE_POINT_MULTIPLIER","unit":"percent","displayScale":100,"sourceDisplayType":"STATBOOSTDISPLAYTYPE_PERCENT","scope":{"characters":["CHARACTERTYPE_COOKIE"],"roles":[],"elements":[]},"order":34,"sortingOrder":2},{"id":1658823655,"name":"體力增幅","nameEn":"體力增幅","nameKey":"CombatPropertyCalculate.DisplayName.HealthPointMultiplier..","calculateType":"COMBATPROPERTYCALCULATETYPE_HEALTH_POINT_MULTIPLIER","unit":"percent","displayScale":100,"sourceDisplayType":"STATBOOSTDISPLAYTYPE_PERCENT","scope":{"characters":["CHARACTERTYPE_COOKIE"],"roles":[],"elements":[]},"order":34,"sortingOrder":3}],"currency":{"id":1075390700,"name":"星際點數","nameEn":"星際點數","description":"重置星際連線時所需的資源。\n對星空許下你的心願吧！","resourceKey":"icon_stellar_point","icon":"/images/tools/icon_stellar_point__5a5a08122f06.png"},"requirements":{"none":{"key":"none","type":"REQUIREMENTTYPE_NONE","label":"無額外配置門檻","labelEn":"無額外配置門檻","template":"","templateEn":"","nameKey":null},"stage_clear":{"key":"stage_clear","type":"REQUIREMENTTYPE_STAGE_CLEAR","label":"通過主線關卡","labelEn":"通過主線關卡","template":"通過關卡{0:N0}","templateEn":"通過關卡{0:N0}","nameKey":"Requirement.StageClear.Description"},"cookie_upgrades":{"key":"cookie_upgrades","type":"REQUIREMENTTYPE_CUMULATIVE_COOKIE_ONLY_UPGRADE_COUNT","label":"累積餅乾升階次數","labelEn":"餅乾累計升階","template":"累積升階餅乾{0}次","templateEn":"累積升階餅乾{0}次","nameKey":"Requirement.CumulativeCookieOnlyUpgradeCount.Description"}},"notes":["10星座配置、100解锁门槛、7档重设费用已对照原始资源。","客户端为全部已保存星座生成各自加成并累积，先前星座不是被最新星座替换。","默认填写游戏整数面积，按已核实的向下取整和整数乘法换算。57%面积、第一星座倍率20%的原始加成为11.39%。","交叉連線先切分交點，再填滿各正向有界區域，已核對客戶端繪圖。網頁以雙精度顯示封閉區域面積參考，尚未重現 float32 的全部臨界值。","官方已公布完整有序排列等機率；繁中表 3～12 星的 10 列總數與公布機率，都和 12P(n) 完全一致。不同輪次的獨立性尚未實測。","8月8日原始游戏录像的完整12星布局显示71%，各封闭面参考71.132%；奇偶填充48.871%和非零绕数56.480%不符。此旧录像支持交叉区域规则，未证明当前版服务端整数取整。","本轮同版完整7星布局显示68%、三类各13.60%；理想封闭面积68.8996%，向下取整吻合，四舍五入69不符。直接素材坐标归一面积69.0974%也不符。","星位模式采用理想封闭区域面积向下取整，再按原生整数规则换算加成；默认仍填游戏显示整数。仅一个当前有区分力布局，服务端退化及数值边界未全验证。","锁0～6星显示费用10、10、30、60、100、150、220；第7锁被拒绝。已解除测试锁，原星位、68%与300点余额保留，未执行重设。","完整位置与连接顺序配置等概率，不代表各种面积等概率；面积和加成由配置计算，不另抽概率。此次只作官方资料与离线模型核对，没有新增游戏内实测。"],"evidence":{"source":"Authenticated/recovered official game configuration, official localization, same-package Cpp2IL metadata","tableSources":[{"table":"ConstellationUnlocks","rows":100,"decodedJsonSha256":"971af7ba0335ba87d4978b01885227f737b6d5c03fb67ee4e70a0b4af3d954ba","protobufSha256":"fef357216e91a2c30b4c43c2c3fb8a85b8693bebebfa3dcdb4966c165ef6cfb8","sqliteRowDigestSha256":"62495427e969b7421cb602b610c905c30540014c30e37177e89ce0724cccf109","sqliteAgainstDecodedJson":"passed","rowDigests":"passed"},{"table":"LinkBonuss","rows":10,"decodedJsonSha256":"b7e6e296d42fd790b91f683e6e2545e75951a30f7d21749fde307d2017f4be24","protobufSha256":"aa0ddec16de2b7290ea5919a656e7a204ba1512b1ce7b4c1fe57046faa92c4b2","sqliteRowDigestSha256":"3f51f2a0654badb701d19c0ec053fc474e7e9dfebe3d8628a6a33a4f961a36d9","sqliteAgainstDecodedJson":"passed","rowDigests":"passed"},{"table":"LinkSuffleCosts","rows":7,"decodedJsonSha256":"e9c7d6cc784295cd8de6d9db651b0aa3df9355537b37a538a72f2377417cb7f7","protobufSha256":"d42e3544547ef7feafc51d14c95dabcf775604f91eddcf20d75e4d7ec7b4374e","sqliteRowDigestSha256":"39b9828070daff7c70ca83c5d5e9e8b64c36317c71a6058760e3f83058462d92","sqliteAgainstDecodedJson":"passed","rowDigests":"passed"},{"table":"StatBoosts","rows":501,"decodedJsonSha256":"6699ac05f5b0992fc04c91321b0951af0bd7e275bb7666643938981ea46770bd","protobufSha256":